HELP=<<END
Name and squash the final work layer, then start the next work layer
Uses the work snapshot's tree and its recorded base as the new commit's parent
The recorded base must match the preceding layer; replay stale work first
Signatures use Name <email> <unix-seconds> <+/-HHMM>
@writer stack
@param stack Conversation-relative stack directory
@param name Layer name without its number prefix; cannot be work
@param author Author signature including timestamp and timezone
@param committer Committer signature including timestamp and timezone
@param message Literal commit message
END
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/git-stack --operation=add-layer --help=$HELP
